   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Whoever tortured and tormented this yeti did an amazing job of pain and destruction. As you gaze upon its fur you notice several vital spots reinforced with stralite plating. One of its arms has been replaced with a steamsaw.",
   "target": "虽然不知道是谁把这个雪人折磨成这样，它的确变成了一个恐怖的杀戮机器。当你凝视着它的皮毛，你注意到它身上的重要部分都被斯莱特装甲所覆盖。它的一只手臂也被替换成了蒸汽链锯。",
